          "content": "**A**\n\nChoosing the society with greater overall prosperity produces the highest aggregate well-being and offers the greatest expected quality of life for an individual chosen at random. Because nearly every segment of the population enjoys a higher standard of living, the total amount of flourishing and net satisfaction generated across the entire society is substantially greater, making it the choice that does the most good for the greatest number of people.",
